tes.\n- Your reservation is only valid for the time(s) and date(s) purchased.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/awAHgeYRgufUgtFpOZvA)\n#Important: Waivers\n\n- Waivers must be signed prior to arrival. Please remember to have each member of your group sign their waiver **before arriving at the rink.**  \n- Each member of your party **must** have a waiver signed to skate.\n\n---------\n###Arrival Instructions\n- We recommend arriving 15 minutes ahead of your scheduled skate time.\n- Check-in will be allowed up to 20 minutes after the scheduled check-in time.\n\n###Weather Disclaimer:\n- Important! Weather conditions, like wind or strong UV exposure, can affect ice conditions. We continue to skate in light rain or drizzle. If there is heavy rain or severe storm conditions are expected, resulting in a venue closure, relevant tickets will be rescheduled or refunded.\n\n###FAQs\n[Click here](https://hoteldel.com/events/skating-by-the-sea/) to view our full list of FAQs.\n\n---------\n\n###Reserve a Frostbite Rink-side Lounge\n- [Reserve](https://www.hoteldel.com/experiences/#!/collection/2a554636-a89f-4011-bb7a-ce465463aa3f?date=2025-11-21&duration=PT1H30M) your own rink-side lounge with a cozy fire pit and food and drink service for up to 12 people.\n- Make the most of the season with even more festive experiences — from holiday movies on the beach to dazzling light displays and seasonal dining. Discover all the ways to celebrate [A Holiday in Oz](https://www.hoteldel.com/experience/holidays/).", "cancellation_notes": "Ticket sales are final. \nCustomers will receive a full refund in case of operator cancellation due to weather.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All Ages • 90 Minutes • Nov 20 - Jan 3 • Tickets must be purchased in advance", "short_description": "The Del's World-Famous Beachfront 